# Template repository

This repo **publishes** cursor-rules-rea. It is the REA counterpart to BOXELS/cursor-rules. It is not an investigation and there is no companion REA-TEMPLATE product.

Copiers take the rules (not this file), the skills, `worker.md`, `.claude/agents/`, `AGENTS.md`, and optionally `docs/` plus `investigations/_template/`.

## Do not

- Do not send users to a second template repo.
- Do not run `/start-investigation` against a real target here unless they chose "starting a real investigation from a clone."
- Do not replace placeholders except when authoring the template.

## Do

- Keep REA lawful-use rules in `rea.mdc` and `security.mdc` intact.
- When a change affects how copies are used, update `README.md` in the same change.

**This file wins on identity.**
